{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and collect object: If found, approach, take, and evaluate it. If not, scan or wander. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanForObjects    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = EvaluateObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Action ID = WanderAround    />",
